WEBVTT

00:00:00.671 --> 00:00:07.969
Open the needle-clamp sketch saved in the last lesson and double-click the sketch in the model tree to edit it

00:00:07.969 --> 00:00:13.669
3 degrees of freedom left: arc size, tab width, tab length. Fix them with dimensions

00:00:13.669 --> 00:00:19.271
Select the arc, click "Radius", type 5.5

00:00:19.271 --> 00:00:24.639
Select the bottom edge, click "Horizontal distance", type 7 (tab width 7)

00:00:24.639 --> 00:00:31.275
Select the origin and the bottom edge, click "Distance", type 7 (bottom edge 7 from the centre)

00:00:31.275 --> 00:00:37.319
"Fully constrained" — the whole sketch turns green: every line's position and size is fixed

00:00:37.319 --> 00:00:49.319
Close the sketch and pad 8 mm: there is the needle clamp (same sizes as the WQ-LS design)
